WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.885
1. Open the link in the email, or To approve on Home, and choose the contract.

2
00:00:06.885 --> 00:00:11.379
2. Check the details, then open the signed copy and check it matches.

3
00:00:11.379 --> 00:00:17.172
3. Something not right? Click Send back and say what needs fixing. It goes back to the owner.

4
00:00:17.172 --> 00:00:22.838
4. All good? Click Approve and register. The contract becomes Effective and is locked.
